@startuml dsp-restart
skinparam dpi 150
title Delivery speed: a gateway release (the newest process acts; new steps in bold)

participant "Old gateway\n(Acting, epoch e)" as OLD
participant "New gateway" as NEW
database "GitHub\nlease ref, plant snapshot ref,\nitem state comments, board, PRs,\nmerge queue" as GH
participant "Octopus\ntask history, deployments,\nSign-offs, runbooks" as OCT
participant "Tentacle hosts\nand worker containers" as H

== the platform starts the new revision ==
NEW -> GH : take the lease at once: epoch e+1 (compare-and-swap)
NEW -> NEW : Starting: serves verbs, webhooks, host reports;\nno plan, no start, no merge, no promotion;\nwaits up to 90 s for the final snapshot

== the old process sees epoch e+1 (within 15 s) ==
OLD -> OLD : stop starting passes\n<b>+ await the running sync-board at most 45 s, then kill it;</b>\n<b>every mutating step already checks the epoch</b>
OLD -> GH : final plant snapshot (existing)\n<b>+ slot ledger, footprints, host-full blocks, runtime health</b>
OLD -> H : end streams (stream.replaced); answer 503 gateway-replaced
note over H : worker containers keep running;\ntheir streams reconnect to the new process

== the new process acts ==
NEW -> GH : restore the snapshot
NEW -> NEW : Acting
NEW -> OCT : rebuild runtime records from the task history (existing)\n<b>+ day budget: every Start and overflow run since 00:00 UTC, host-full ones excepted</b>
NEW -> OCT : <b>run Reconcile hosts once (retry once; else the scheduled run)</b>
H -> NEW : <b>host reports: containers + metrics</b>
NEW -> NEW : <b>ledger = snapshot + task history, corrected by the reports;</b>\n<b>sessions that ended during the handover are freed here</b>
NEW -> GH : first sweep: board, claims, item state comments\n(<b>holds, durable budgets, merge entries, evidence, flow times</b>)
NEW -> OCT : <b>deployments, Sign-offs and smoke tasks read back;</b>\n<b>due timers recomputed from their finish times</b>
NEW -> NEW : <b>first plan pass; triggers queued while Starting run now</b>

== a holder with no successor (scale-in) ==
OLD -> GH : at SIGTERM: final snapshot, release the lease (existing)
@enduml
